v 3
d datadeposit: archive-ready data deposits that open the same way in Stata, R, Python, and Excel
d
d datadeposit writes the kind of folder that data archives such as ICPSR and
d Harvard Dataverse distribute: the data as csv plus Stata and R copies, a
d codebook (Markdown, Excel, DDI Codebook 2.5, Frictionless datapackage.json),
d and setup scripts that rebuild the labelled data from the csv in Stata, R,
d and Python. Variable labels, value labels, extended missing codes, notes,
d label languages, and survey item text stored in characteristics all travel
d with the data. A size check stops deposits with files over 5 GB unless you
d choose the lean profile (native file plus csv), nodata, or allowlarge.
d
d The same command exists in R and Python; all three write the same folder.
d
d Start with: help datadeposit
d
d Requires: Stata version 16
d
d Author: Eric A. Booth
d Support: email eric.a.booth@gmail.com
d
d Version: 0.1.0
d Distribution-Date: 20261109
